  "instruction": "Prefixes Div By5",
  "output": "    public List<Boolean> prefixesDivBy5(int[] nums) {\n        List<Boolean> result = new ArrayList<>();\n        int num = 0;\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n            num = (num * 2 + nums[i]) % 5;\n            result.add(num == 0);\n        }\n        \n        return result;\n    }",
